1
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
"Not Yours"

2
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:00,800
(Episode 3)

3
00:01:34,359 --> 00:01:35,359
Come here.

4
00:01:36,159 --> 00:01:37,159
What now?

5
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,280
Cut the chatter.

6
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:39,760
Get over here.

7
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,000
Say what you need to say.

8
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,439
I have work to finish.

9
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:48,760
Once I'm done, I have
a shift at the restaurant.

10
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:51,799
Hold still.

11
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:52,200
What are you doing?

12
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,400
Hey, let go!

13
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,920
Don't move.

14
00:02:20,919 --> 00:02:22,000
Are you out of your mind?

15
00:02:22,319 --> 00:02:23,319
I haven't hit back

16
00:02:23,719 --> 00:02:25,719
only out of respect for
your position as the boss.

17
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:29,080
But don't mistake me for a pushover.

18
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,120
If you keep this up,

19
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:32,960
I swear I'll fight back.

20
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,280
Look at you.

21
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,159
Completely ungrateful.

22
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:42,759
I saw you cut yourself,

23
00:02:43,319 --> 00:02:45,479
so I kindly helped disinfect
it and stop the bleeding.

24
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,400
Instead of thanking me,

25
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:48,560
you threaten to hit me?

26
00:02:49,159 --> 00:02:50,240
It wasn't a snakebite!

27
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,760
Did you really have to suck on it?

28
00:02:58,960 --> 00:02:59,960
Besides,

29
00:03:00,318 --> 00:03:02,775
I haven't even settled that score for
what you pulled on me yesterday yet.

30
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,800
Get over here!

31
00:03:04,479 --> 00:03:05,159
Mingkun!

32
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:05,680
Save me!

33
00:03:06,159 --> 00:03:07,439
Is your boss totally insane?

34
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,120
It's all right.

35
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,320
He's just messing with you.

36
00:03:13,439 --> 00:03:15,239
Master P'Aya asked
you to join him for lunch.

37
00:03:18,039 --> 00:03:19,439
Fine, got it.

38
00:03:22,199 --> 00:03:23,319
When I'm done eating,

39
00:03:23,879 --> 00:03:25,080
we'll keep playing.

40
00:03:37,639 --> 00:03:38,639
Mingkun,

41
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,560
please let me leave.

42
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:42,280
I'm terrified that when he comes back,

43
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:42,960
he'll just

44
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,240
do something awful to me again.

45
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:46,639
All right.

46
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,760
I'll arrange for someone
to see you out in a moment.

47
00:03:58,039 --> 00:03:59,039
This...

48
00:03:59,199 --> 00:04:00,439
this room alone

49
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,919
feels bigger than my entire house.

50
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,560
The rich truly live in a different world.

51
00:04:15,919 --> 00:04:16,920
Hello, Mr. Pao.

52
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:19,959
Mr. Mingkun instructed us to
prepare these new clothes for you.

53
00:04:20,319 --> 00:04:21,600
As for your old clothes,

54
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,576
we'll take them to be
professionally laundered.

55
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,799
Once they're clean,

56
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:27,160
we'll have someone deliver
them directly to your residence.

57
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,720
You're too kind.

58
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,696
There's really no need
to go through the trouble.

59
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,000
I can just wear my own clothes.

60
00:04:32,079 --> 00:04:34,000
If you insist on wearing your own clothes,

61
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:36,479
you may need to speak
with Mr. Mingkun first.

62
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:39,040
I don't have the authority to decide.

63
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,120
I'll wear these, then.

64
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,680
Very well.

65
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,560
I'd better change quickly
and get out of here.

66
00:04:58,639 --> 00:05:00,240
Once that monster finishes lunch,

67
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,240
there will be no escaping him.

68
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:23,679
I hear you're dissatisfied
with the new head chef again.

69
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:25,360
What's the issue this time?

70
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:27,199
Nothing.

71
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,600
Just not to my taste.

72
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:32,878
As luck would have it, through a friend,

73
00:05:32,879 --> 00:05:34,240
I brought in another head chef.

74
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,399
His résumé is quite impressive.

75
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:39,439
He'll be preparing our dessert after lunch.

76
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,560
Give it a try,

77
00:05:40,959 --> 00:05:42,839
and see if it satisfies
your discerning palate.

78
00:05:46,639 --> 00:05:47,639
Oh, by the way,

79
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:50,240
regarding that livestream sales event,

80
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,879
I went over the report.

81
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:54,040
The numbers were remarkable.

82
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:56,040
The board is very pleased.

83
00:06:03,959 --> 00:06:05,519
With things going so smoothly,

84
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:09,199
how was your collaboration
with that star from Huabo...

85
00:06:09,879 --> 00:06:11,759
Li Milan, was it?

86
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,399
Did you two get along well?

87
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,519
Were there any issues?

88
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:18,840
What could possibly go wrong?

89
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:21,279
It was strictly business.

90
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,599
He did his job,

91
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,839
and I achieved my goal.

92
00:06:25,439 --> 00:06:26,480
A clean transaction.

93
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:27,879
That's good to hear.

94
00:06:28,079 --> 00:06:31,240
You know your health
comes before anything else.

95
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,399
That allergic reaction yesterday—

96
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,279
don't let it happen again.

97
00:06:37,399 --> 00:06:38,680
You know,

98
00:06:39,079 --> 00:06:40,439
my heart isn't in this business.

99
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,680
The company affairs,

100
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:45,079
the burden Father left behind,

101
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:47,519
they'll ultimately fall on your shoulders.

102
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,878
After all,

103
00:06:49,879 --> 00:06:52,639
you're the one Father
cherished most since childhood.

104
00:06:53,759 --> 00:06:56,079
You're sharp and resourceful.

105
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:59,480
Unlike me, slow to react,

106
00:06:59,879 --> 00:07:01,759
already falling behind the times.

107
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:04,959
Cherished me?

108
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:07,800
Fine.

109
00:07:08,279 --> 00:07:10,879
You have your artistic pursuits,

110
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:13,920
and I'll oversee the company.

111
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,079
As for your private life,

112
00:07:20,079 --> 00:07:21,319
fool around all you like,

113
00:07:21,959 --> 00:07:23,399
but know your boundaries.

114
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,279
Don't cross the line

115
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,959
and invite needless trouble.

116
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:30,600
After all, you're somewhat
of a public figure.

117
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,839
Countless eyes are watching you.

118
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:36,000
Don't let irrelevant people

119
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,399
tarnish the group's reputation.

120
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:41,638
Otherwise, the brand image
Father built over the years

121
00:07:41,639 --> 00:07:44,079
with so much blood and sweat

122
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:45,839
will go down the drain.

123
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:53,319
And that contract—

124
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,240
keep its clauses firmly in mind.

125
00:07:56,199 --> 00:07:59,120
Otherwise, when the time comes,

126
00:08:00,519 --> 00:08:03,319
brotherly affection won't
stop me from acting.

127
00:08:08,079 --> 00:08:09,079
Don't worry.

128
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,680
I know the rules.

129
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,639
I won't violate them.

130
00:08:14,079 --> 00:08:15,839
I won't give anyone—

131
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,279
especially you—

132
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:21,199
an excuse to kick me out.

133
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,440
Good.

134
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:38,159
Oh, right.

135
00:08:38,279 --> 00:08:40,278
About what I mentioned to you last time,

136
00:08:40,279 --> 00:08:43,840
regarding that countryside
variety show on modern agriculture,

137
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,535
has the group considered title sponsorship?

138
00:08:46,559 --> 00:08:47,559
Yeah.

139
00:08:47,879 --> 00:08:49,239
The project is still under review.

140
00:08:49,799 --> 00:08:51,119
There is interest in sponsorship.

141
00:08:51,399 --> 00:08:52,440
However,

142
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:55,519
they still need to find
guests who draw ratings.

143
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:58,839
I think if they bring in attractive,

144
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:01,398
buzzworthy everyday guys,

145
00:09:01,399 --> 00:09:02,720
it should work quite well.

146
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,919
[Do Not Enter]
Why is this room so weird?

147
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:54,960
It's freezing in here.

148
00:09:55,759 --> 00:09:57,159
What's inside?

149
00:10:05,639 --> 00:10:06,840
What are you doing?

150
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,398
Oh, it's you!

151
00:10:08,399 --> 00:10:09,879
You scared the life out of me.

152
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:12,840
Listen to me carefully.

153
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:15,120
Only Master P'Eng is
permitted inside this room.

154
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:17,879
If anyone enters without permission,

155
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:20,039
the punishment will be severe.

156
00:10:21,559 --> 00:10:22,799
What happened today

157
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,720
must remain strictly confidential.

158
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:26,840
Keep it secret?

159
00:10:27,039 --> 00:10:28,200
Secret about what?

160
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,399
Keep secret that you ever came near,

161
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,840
much less opened this door.

162
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,799
I wasn't trying to go in.

163
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,440
The note fell off,

164
00:10:35,679 --> 00:10:37,360
and I was only trying to stick it back on.

165
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:40,000
So you're saying

166
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:41,720
the door wasn't locked,

167
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,000
it was already open?

168
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:43,679
Yeah.

169
00:10:43,679 --> 00:10:44,440
It was wide open.

170
00:10:44,441 --> 00:10:45,521
It's not like I have a key.

171
00:10:46,159 --> 00:10:47,159
In any case,

172
00:10:47,399 --> 00:10:48,720
act as if nothing ever happened.

173
00:10:48,919 --> 00:10:50,239
Take this secret to your grave.

174
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,240
Do you understand?

175
00:10:51,679 --> 00:10:52,279
Yeah.

176
00:10:52,559 --> 00:10:53,559
Understood.

177
00:10:53,879 --> 00:10:56,638
While Master P'Aya and
Master P'Eng are in a meeting,

178
00:10:56,639 --> 00:10:57,959
I'll smuggle you out immediately.

179
00:10:58,919 --> 00:10:59,919
Come with me, quickly.

180
00:11:00,879 --> 00:11:01,879
Okay.

181
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,759
Mr. Mingkun,

182
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:14,798
that 'severe punishment'
you mentioned earlier,

183
00:11:14,799 --> 00:11:17,120
what does it actually mean?

184
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,600
What if one day that monster—

185
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:19,559
I mean,

186
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:21,038
your master—

187
00:11:21,039 --> 00:11:23,039
checks the security footage and finds out?

188
00:11:23,399 --> 00:11:24,696
Isn't he obsessed with
watching the cameras?

189
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,639
In truth,

190
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:27,519
it's not guaranteed that
he would punish you.

191
00:11:27,919 --> 00:11:29,720
His bark is much worse than his bite.

192
00:11:30,039 --> 00:11:31,879
It's usually all thunder and no rain.

193
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,359
You don't need to worry so much.

194
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:35,399
At worst, it'll cost some money.

195
00:11:36,679 --> 00:11:37,120
Then,

196
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,559
that's completely fine!

197
00:11:38,919 --> 00:11:40,480
He never paid me wages anyway.

198
00:11:40,919 --> 00:11:41,720
I don't have any money,

199
00:11:41,721 --> 00:11:42,759
so how could he fine me?

200
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,600
Still, everyone who has ever gone inside

201
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,039
always ends up...

202
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:07,879
A Pong!

203
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:08,519
Yeah?

204
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:09,919
What are you doing here today?

205
00:12:10,679 --> 00:12:11,879
Didn't you take the day off?

206
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,200
Oh, no.

207
00:12:13,279 --> 00:12:14,559
Pao Bei had an emergency,

208
00:12:14,639 --> 00:12:15,678
something urgent came up,

209
00:12:15,679 --> 00:12:16,959
so he asked me to cover for him.

210
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:20,239
And this handsome guy...

211
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,200
is he a friend of yours?

212
00:12:21,201 --> 00:12:22,239
Oh, no.

213
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:22,679
He's just—.

214
00:12:22,679 --> 00:12:23,440
That's right, Boss.

215
00:12:23,679 --> 00:12:25,200
We were classmates in college.

216
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:26,678
I know what an exceptional cook he is,

217
00:12:26,679 --> 00:12:27,440
and that he works here,

218
00:12:27,441 --> 00:12:29,481
so I came by specifically
to support your business.

219
00:12:29,679 --> 00:12:32,360
You look so familiar to me.

220
00:12:32,919 --> 00:12:34,615
Weren't you doing a promotional
event nearby yesterday?

221
00:12:34,639 --> 00:12:35,999
That big celebrity...

222
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,279
what's your name again?

223
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:38,840
Yes, Boss.

224
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,120
My name is Li Milan.

225
00:12:40,879 --> 00:12:41,600
Oh, my goodness!

226
00:12:41,639 --> 00:12:42,720
It really is you!

227
00:12:43,279 --> 00:12:44,600
A Pong, you little rascal!

228
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,918
You have a famous friend like him,

229
00:12:46,919 --> 00:12:48,320
and you kept it hidden from me?

230
00:12:49,559 --> 00:12:50,480
Welcome, welcome!

231
00:12:50,559 --> 00:12:51,759
Please, come inside.

232
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:55,720
Right this way.

233
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:57,480
Have a seat.

234
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,120
Clear this table.

235
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:58,679
Pour some water.

236
00:12:58,759 --> 00:12:59,759
Here you are.

237
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:05,519
Thank you.

238
00:13:05,519 --> 00:13:06,200
Have some water first.

239
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:08,359
Here is our menu.

240
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:09,800
Take a look and see what you'd like.

241
00:13:10,039 --> 00:13:12,158
I'll have A Pong cook
for you himself today.

242
00:13:12,159 --> 00:13:13,080
You won't be disappointed!

243
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:13,799
Boss,

244
00:13:13,799 --> 00:13:14,799
no need for a menu.

245
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,960
Just let A Pong prepare his specialties.

246
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,360
Whatever he makes, I'll eat.

247
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,759
I'm good at everything on the menu.

248
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,240
Pick for yourself.

249
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:25,440
Oh, he's only joking!

250
00:13:25,639 --> 00:13:26,639
That's just how he is.

251
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:29,079
He always banters like this with regulars.

252
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:30,080
Please don't mind him.

253
00:13:30,279 --> 00:13:31,840
Let A Pong decide what to prepare.

254
00:13:32,159 --> 00:13:34,360
Didn't you always
know what I like to eat?

255
00:13:34,639 --> 00:13:36,279
My tastes haven't changed over the years.

256
00:13:36,399 --> 00:13:37,200
It's still the same old favorites.

257
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:39,120
You just said it's been years.

258
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:41,000
How am I supposed to
remember what you like?

259
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:52,320
How about this:

260
00:13:53,879 --> 00:13:56,120
cook every single dish on the menu.

261
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:58,279
What? Every single dish?

262
00:13:58,639 --> 00:14:00,559
You couldn't possibly finish all that.

263
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:01,879
That doesn't matter.

264
00:14:01,879 --> 00:14:02,759
If I can't finish,

265
00:14:02,759 --> 00:14:03,559
I'll pack it up to go.

266
00:14:03,583 --> 00:14:04,742
"I'll pack it up to go."

267
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:07,959
What is wrong with you today?

268
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,120
Did you take the wrong pills?

269
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:10,039
Fix your attitude.

270
00:14:10,039 --> 00:14:11,039
Go on.

271
00:14:11,279 --> 00:14:12,279
Hurry up.

272
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,440
Get cooking,

273
00:14:15,679 --> 00:14:17,240
old classmate.

274
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:21,359
Certainly, dear customer.

275
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:23,558
I'll go prepare it for you right now.

276
00:14:23,559 --> 00:14:25,120
Thanks for the hard work.

277
00:14:27,759 --> 00:14:28,200
Come here.

278
00:14:28,399 --> 00:14:28,840
Hurry.

279
00:14:29,159 --> 00:14:30,720
Take a photo of me with the star!

280
00:14:34,039 --> 00:14:35,039
Say cheese!

281
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:38,840
What a total phony.

282
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:42,120
How did he grow up to be even
more irritating than when he was a kid?

283
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:47,120
Great.

284
00:14:47,519 --> 00:14:48,519
Just look at him.

285
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,240
What's his angle?

286
00:14:52,279 --> 00:14:53,839
Did he already recognize me?

287
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:55,200
Is he setting a trap for me?

288
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,799
He'll toss his chopsticks aside,

289
00:14:58,919 --> 00:15:00,080
claim the food tastes awful,

290
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,600
and ruin my culinary reputation!

291
00:15:04,039 --> 00:15:05,519
Like I'd let him play me like a fool.

292
00:15:06,879 --> 00:15:08,278
He messed with me our entire childhood,

293
00:15:08,279 --> 00:15:10,039
and I'm supposed to
fall for it as an adult?

294
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,200
If his fans

295
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:14,120
ever knew what he
was really like in college

296
00:15:14,399 --> 00:15:15,679
and still adored him,

297
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:17,480
I'd call him my daddy.

298
00:15:18,879 --> 00:15:19,600
What are you doing?

299
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,720
Why are you daydreaming?

300
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:23,176
With all these dishes,
why aren't you moving?

301
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,200
Get cracking already!

302
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,440
Boss,

303
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:28,439
you really expect me
to make all this alone?

304
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,638
Aren't you going to help me?

305
00:15:29,639 --> 00:15:32,359
The big star specifically
asked for you to cook.

306
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,439
I just asked him.

307
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:34,758
He seems to be from Chuanzhou.

308
00:15:34,759 --> 00:15:35,878
He loves bold, heavy flavors.

309
00:15:35,879 --> 00:15:38,200
Make sure to load on the extra chili!

310
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,080
Yeah.

311
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,080
Listen, kid,

312
00:15:43,879 --> 00:15:45,398
put your heart into this.

313
00:15:45,399 --> 00:15:47,200
If he enjoys the food

314
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,200
and leaves happy,

315
00:15:49,399 --> 00:15:52,279
all he has to do is post
a few photos online.

316
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,879
Think of the free publicity!

317
00:15:55,159 --> 00:15:57,320
Our place might blow up overnight.

318
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:00,120
Do an exceptional job.

319
00:16:00,799 --> 00:16:03,519
It doesn't matter if we break even today.

320
00:16:05,799 --> 00:16:07,679
Since you're so close with him,

321
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:11,080
put in a good word for us.

322
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:12,320
Mm-hmm.

323
00:16:12,799 --> 00:16:13,759
Now hurry up and get cooking.

324
00:16:13,759 --> 00:16:14,200
Sure.

325
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,039
Make it fantastic, got it?

326
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:15,879
Right.

327
00:16:15,879 --> 00:16:16,879
Give it your all.

328
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:19,840
I'll do an unforgettable job.

329
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:24,600
Loves spicy food, does he?

330
00:16:25,440 --> 00:16:28,960
I'll make sure this meal is
seared into your memory forever.

331
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,840
Did you see my brother off?

332
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:03,799
Yes.

333
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:05,800
Master P'Aya has already
left for the art gallery.

334
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:11,799
He barely visits once in a blue moon.

335
00:17:12,519 --> 00:17:13,920
How is it that of all times,

336
00:17:14,519 --> 00:17:16,079
the exact moment I bring someone home,

337
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:17,480
he suddenly turns up?

338
00:17:18,799 --> 00:17:20,399
Could he be having someone spy on me?

339
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:23,400
That is why I keep
reminding you to stay alert.

340
00:17:31,039 --> 00:17:32,160
The more he acts like this,

341
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,160
the more I want to push back.

342
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,400
Where's the kid?

343
00:17:39,599 --> 00:17:40,720
He...

344
00:17:40,839 --> 00:17:42,159
he is still in the garden,

345
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,759
finishing his mother's tasks for today.

346
00:17:47,119 --> 00:17:49,640
Send him to my room.

347
00:17:51,119 --> 00:17:52,119
Young Master,

348
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:54,518
noticing your exhaustion lately,

349
00:17:54,519 --> 00:17:55,720
I took the liberty

350
00:17:56,039 --> 00:17:57,440
of booking Masseur Chen

351
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:59,480
to help you unwind with a massage.

352
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:02,119
He is already waiting outside your room.

353
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,680
Fine, then.

354
00:18:05,559 --> 00:18:06,719
I'll enjoy the massage first.

355
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:12,799
That kid has some serious muscle.

356
00:18:13,799 --> 00:18:15,680
Nearly threw my back out.

357
00:18:18,599 --> 00:18:20,240
Once I'm done relaxing,

358
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:22,520
I'll take my sweet time dealing with him.

359
00:18:38,279 --> 00:18:39,279
Boss P'Eng,

360
00:18:39,559 --> 00:18:41,000
is this pressure all right?

361
00:18:41,519 --> 00:18:42,519
Yeah.

362
00:18:43,039 --> 00:18:44,039
It's fine.

363
00:18:46,319 --> 00:18:47,359
A little lighter, please.

364
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:49,559
Right away, sir.

365
00:18:54,519 --> 00:18:55,679
What are you chuckling about?

366
00:18:56,559 --> 00:18:57,599
I was just thinking...

367
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:00,160
Boss P'Eng, your pressure tolerance

368
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:02,440
isn't nearly as high
as that star's last time.

369
00:19:03,599 --> 00:19:05,720
He looked so fair and delicate,

370
00:19:05,839 --> 00:19:07,599
yet he could really
handle intense pressure.

371
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:09,759
Oh?

372
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:11,000
And how did it go?

373
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:13,319
How did he like our technique?

374
00:19:14,559 --> 00:19:16,720
He must have been satisfied.

375
00:19:16,839 --> 00:19:18,559
When I arrived,

376
00:19:18,799 --> 00:19:20,759
he had already received
a full round of massage.

377
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:23,960
His entire body was
slathered in our new soy sauce.

378
00:19:24,839 --> 00:19:25,999
It was quite amusing, really.

379
00:19:27,799 --> 00:19:29,400
Covered in soy sauce?

380
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,040
What are you talking about?

381
00:19:31,079 --> 00:19:32,079
Explain yourself clearly.

382
00:19:32,359 --> 00:19:33,359
Here you go.

383
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:34,000
Thank you.

384
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:35,200
You're welcome.

385
00:19:36,359 --> 00:19:37,279
Boss, we're taking off!

386
00:19:37,319 --> 00:19:38,479
Take care! Come again soon!

387
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:39,160
Bye-bye.

388
00:19:39,440 --> 00:19:40,440
Bye!

389
00:19:49,039 --> 00:19:50,039
Boss,

390
00:19:50,279 --> 00:19:51,999
are you closing up shop?

391
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,558
What kind of talk is that?

392
00:19:53,559 --> 00:19:55,680
You ordered every single dish on our menu.

393
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:57,879
How could we possibly cater to anyone else?

394
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:58,680
Besides,

395
00:19:58,681 --> 00:20:00,758
you're our distinguished VIP.

396
00:20:00,759 --> 00:20:02,439
Today, we're dedicated exclusively to you.

397
00:20:02,799 --> 00:20:03,599
Boss,

398
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:04,720
that's not what I intended.

399
00:20:05,079 --> 00:20:07,240
Why not have A Pong prepare fewer dishes?

400
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:09,015
I can't get in the way of your business.

401
00:20:09,039 --> 00:20:09,720
Not at all.

402
00:20:09,721 --> 00:20:10,801
It's no problem at all.

403
00:20:27,759 --> 00:20:28,759
A Pong!

404
00:20:28,799 --> 00:20:30,399
Is business this booming this afternoon?

405
00:20:30,599 --> 00:20:31,599
So many orders!

406
00:20:31,799 --> 00:20:33,159
Did you finish what you had to do?

407
00:20:35,319 --> 00:20:37,200
Pretty much.

408
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:38,839
What was it?

409
00:20:38,839 --> 00:20:39,839
Acting all mysterious.

410
00:20:40,519 --> 00:20:41,519
Give me the details.

411
00:20:44,839 --> 00:20:46,199
You made all these dishes,

412
00:20:46,200 --> 00:20:47,320
why haven't you served them?

413
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:48,640
Leave them there.

414
00:20:48,680 --> 00:20:49,760
They're all for one person.

415
00:20:50,319 --> 00:20:51,000
Huh?

416
00:20:51,279 --> 00:20:52,279
Just one person?

417
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:54,599
You made so much food.
Can he even eat all that?

418
00:20:55,279 --> 00:20:56,839
Go out and see for yourself.

419
00:20:57,079 --> 00:20:58,079
Hey.

420
00:20:58,279 --> 00:20:59,400
What's with the clothes?

421
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:01,359
Dressed so sharply in the kitchen—

422
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:02,960
did you strike gold?

423
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:07,919
If it gets crowded,

424
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,720
dressing nicely might
attract some followers,

425
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:11,480
which could boost business here too.

426
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,520
I'll take them out for you, then.

427
00:21:15,599 --> 00:21:16,839
How bizarre.

428
00:21:17,559 --> 00:21:19,680
Since when can that guy
afford such high-end threads?

429
00:21:20,079 --> 00:21:23,160
Looks like there's a new development.

430
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:28,799
Food is here!

431
00:21:29,240 --> 00:21:30,880
It's Milan from yesterday.

432
00:21:31,519 --> 00:21:32,720
What is he doing here?

433
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:35,120
And ordering all these dishes for himself?

434
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:39,240
Whoa!

435
00:21:39,240 --> 00:21:40,240
Watch it!

436
00:21:40,640 --> 00:21:41,880
Take it easy.

437
00:21:42,119 --> 00:21:43,640
So clumsy!

438
00:21:44,119 --> 00:21:45,960
What if you spilled soy sauce on our guest?

439
00:21:46,079 --> 00:21:47,079
It's fine.

440
00:21:47,359 --> 00:21:48,359
Soy sauce...

441
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:51,279
seems to love sticking to my body anyway.

442
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:56,720
Please,

443
00:21:57,119 --> 00:21:59,559
taste it while it's piping hot.

444
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:01,720
If it suits your palate,

445
00:22:02,079 --> 00:22:04,720
I have a small favor to ask.

446
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:07,279
Boss,

447
00:22:07,599 --> 00:22:08,640
no need to be polite.

448
00:22:08,799 --> 00:22:10,439
Just tell me what you need.

449
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:12,838
Could you perhaps give
our humble restaurant

450
00:22:12,839 --> 00:22:15,640
a recommendation on your social media?

451
00:22:16,359 --> 00:22:17,519
Of course, no problem at all.

452
00:22:17,759 --> 00:22:19,479
Even if just for A Pong's sake,

453
00:22:19,480 --> 00:22:20,480
I'd gladly recommend it.

454
00:22:20,759 --> 00:22:22,558
Not to mention you closed
the whole restaurant for me.

455
00:22:22,559 --> 00:22:24,240
It's only right that I do.

456
00:22:24,599 --> 00:22:25,000
That's fantastic!

457
00:22:25,079 --> 00:22:26,160
Thank you so very much!

458
00:22:26,559 --> 00:22:27,480
- Please, dig in.
- Don't mention it.

459
00:22:27,519 --> 00:22:27,920
Mm.

460
00:22:27,920 --> 00:22:28,920
It's delicious.

461
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:30,400
Enjoy.

462
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:35,519
Mingkun!

463
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:36,559
Mingkun, where are you?

464
00:22:36,560 --> 00:22:38,200
What are your orders, Young Master?

465
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:39,440
Where is that kid?

466
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:40,279
Bring him here.

467
00:22:40,279 --> 00:22:41,039
I have things to ask him.

468
00:22:41,079 --> 00:22:41,960
Young Master,

469
00:22:41,961 --> 00:22:44,400
he should still be working in the garden.

470
00:22:44,559 --> 00:22:45,896
Is there something you need him for?

471
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:46,519
Tell me,

472
00:22:46,720 --> 00:22:48,360
did you know our brand ambassador, Milan,

473
00:22:48,680 --> 00:22:51,519
was attacked during a scheduled massage
and covered head-to-toe in soy sauce?

474
00:22:51,519 --> 00:22:53,039
- Were you aware of this?
- What?

475
00:22:53,079 --> 00:22:54,319
Such a thing happened?

476
00:22:54,519 --> 00:22:54,960
Young Master,

477
00:22:54,961 --> 00:22:56,295
this is the first I'm hearing of it.

478
00:22:56,319 --> 00:22:57,599
How do you do your job?

479
00:22:58,039 --> 00:22:59,616
If Masseur Chen hadn't mentioned it to me,

480
00:22:59,640 --> 00:23:00,879
I wouldn't have known our own ambassador

481
00:23:00,880 --> 00:23:02,680
was so thoroughly
humiliated on our own turf!

482
00:23:03,079 --> 00:23:04,079
I'm sorry, Young Master.

483
00:23:04,200 --> 00:23:05,760
This is truly a grave lapse on my part.

484
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:07,040
I'll investigate right away

485
00:23:07,079 --> 00:23:08,335
and find out who is behind this.

486
00:23:08,359 --> 00:23:09,359
No need to investigate.

487
00:23:10,880 --> 00:23:12,880
It was definitely that
crude friend of Pao Bei's!

488
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:14,680
Go find Pao Bei right now

489
00:23:15,319 --> 00:23:16,920
and tell him to cough up his friend!

490
00:23:17,119 --> 00:23:17,680
Young Master,

491
00:23:18,039 --> 00:23:19,358
it's broad daylight,

492
00:23:19,359 --> 00:23:20,359
and without any evidence,

493
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:22,720
seizing someone like
this might not be wise.

494
00:23:24,839 --> 00:23:25,839
Evidence?

495
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:28,560
Let me spell it out for you:

496
00:23:29,039 --> 00:23:31,159
that night, he gave me
flowers out of nowhere.

497
00:23:31,160 --> 00:23:32,200
It all makes sense now.

498
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:34,000
His target was never me.

499
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:35,640
He thought Milan was inside that car!

500
00:23:36,279 --> 00:23:38,039
Oh, yes, Young Master.

501
00:23:38,359 --> 00:23:40,440
There was indeed a slight
mix-up with the vehicles.

502
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:42,758
Still, I fail to see

503
00:23:42,759 --> 00:23:44,200
what this has to do with his friend.

504
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:46,519
Do you have rocks in your head?

505
00:23:47,279 --> 00:23:48,815
He assumed I was the one inside my car,

506
00:23:48,839 --> 00:23:49,959
so he tailed it all the way!

507
00:23:50,079 --> 00:23:51,815
Because I reported him for
selling illegal lottery tickets,

508
00:23:51,839 --> 00:23:53,640
he held a grudge and wanted revenge on me.

509
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:55,920
And by pure mistake,

510
00:23:56,599 --> 00:23:58,119
he assaulted our talent Milan instead!

511
00:23:59,079 --> 00:24:00,518
Oh!

512
00:24:00,519 --> 00:24:01,640
I see!

513
00:24:01,960 --> 00:24:03,320
Brilliant deduction, Young Master.

514
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:08,640
So go find Pao Bei right now,

515
00:24:09,160 --> 00:24:10,840
and make him tell you where his friend is!

516
00:24:12,160 --> 00:24:13,480
I'm settling that score today.

517
00:24:14,319 --> 00:24:16,680
Touching my people on my territory—

518
00:24:16,920 --> 00:24:18,319
he must have a death wish!

519
00:24:20,960 --> 00:24:21,976
What are you standing there for?

520
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:23,280
Do you need a formal invitation?

521
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:24,440
Young Master...

522
00:24:24,920 --> 00:24:25,240
I...

523
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:28,000
Pao Bei already went
back to his restaurant job.

524
00:24:28,640 --> 00:24:29,960
Back to the restaurant?

525
00:24:32,279 --> 00:24:33,279
The restaurant...

526
00:24:48,559 --> 00:24:49,559
Good.

527
00:24:51,279 --> 00:24:52,279
Very good.

528
00:24:55,359 --> 00:24:56,359
Move.

529
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:58,599
Take me to that dump where they work.

530
00:25:00,240 --> 00:25:03,039
Today, I'm taking them both down!

531
00:25:03,079 --> 00:25:05,000
Young Master!

532
00:25:19,519 --> 00:25:20,720
Hello? Anyone here?

533
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:31,798
Sorry, folks.

534
00:25:31,799 --> 00:25:33,400
We're closed for private dining today.

535
00:25:37,440 --> 00:25:38,680
Are you sure this is the place?

536
00:25:39,519 --> 00:25:40,558
The address is correct, Young Master.

537
00:25:40,559 --> 00:25:41,640
Don't fret, let me ask.

538
00:25:43,359 --> 00:25:44,240
Excuse me, Boss.

539
00:25:44,241 --> 00:25:45,440
We're not here to eat.

540
00:25:45,599 --> 00:25:46,719
In your kitchen,

541
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:48,318
is there a young man named Pao Bei

542
00:25:48,319 --> 00:25:49,160
working here?

543
00:25:49,319 --> 00:25:50,439
Pao...

544
00:25:50,440 --> 00:25:51,839
Pao Bei?

545
00:25:52,119 --> 00:25:53,399
He took the day off today. He's not here.

546
00:25:53,400 --> 00:25:55,119
What do you need him for?

547
00:25:55,279 --> 00:25:56,559
I can pass along a message.

548
00:25:58,640 --> 00:25:59,440
Young Master,

549
00:25:59,640 --> 00:26:00,959
he says he isn't here.

550
00:26:00,960 --> 00:26:01,960
Should we...

551
00:26:04,759 --> 00:26:05,559
Open the door.

552
00:26:05,560 --> 00:26:08,118
I told you, we're not
open for business today.

553
00:26:08,119 --> 00:26:09,199
Please come back another day.

554
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:10,400
I said open the door.

555
00:26:18,799 --> 00:26:21,078
I said we're closed!

556
00:26:21,079 --> 00:26:22,640
Open the door!

557
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:25,200
Young Master!

558
00:26:26,559 --> 00:26:27,000
Young Master,

559
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:27,920
let's calm down.

560
00:26:27,920 --> 00:26:28,920
Out of my way!

561
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:34,160
Boss P'Eng?

562
00:26:43,079 --> 00:26:44,079
Are you all right?

563
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:46,279
What are you doing here?

564
00:26:46,279 --> 00:26:46,680
Young Master!

565
00:26:46,681 --> 00:26:48,039
Why were you so reckless?

566
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:54,079
Why are you here too?

567
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:58,279
Did you come to catch him too?

568
00:26:58,559 --> 00:26:59,559
Catch someone?

569
00:27:01,119 --> 00:27:02,000
Catch who?

570
00:27:02,001 --> 00:27:03,240
You're really something else.

571
00:27:03,420 --> 00:27:05,275
Getting pushed around
and keeping quiet about it.

572
00:27:05,319 --> 00:27:09,342
I came to nail the bastard who rubbed
soy sauce all over you during your massage!

573
00:27:12,799 --> 00:27:14,079
Isn't that why you're here?

574
00:27:14,519 --> 00:27:15,759
Wait, Mr. Milan,

575
00:27:15,920 --> 00:27:18,480
did you order this entire
table of food by yourself?

576
00:27:19,799 --> 00:27:21,160
Oh, yeah.

577
00:27:21,359 --> 00:27:22,639
I might have ordered a bit much.

578
00:27:22,640 --> 00:27:23,758
I can't finish it alone.

579
00:27:23,759 --> 00:27:24,559
Why don't you join me?

580
00:27:24,599 --> 00:27:25,599
The food is really good.

581
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:26,960
Don't mind if I do.

582
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:28,519
Young Master.

583
00:27:28,559 --> 00:27:29,559
Right this way.

584
00:27:30,839 --> 00:27:31,839
Over here.

585
00:27:38,880 --> 00:27:39,680
Have some water.

586
00:27:39,759 --> 00:27:40,759
Pardon the intrusion.

587
00:27:44,240 --> 00:27:45,640
How did he track us down here?

588
00:27:51,359 --> 00:27:52,519
Hurry.

589
00:27:54,519 --> 00:27:54,960
Boss,

590
00:27:54,960 --> 00:27:55,960
yeah?

591
00:27:56,039 --> 00:27:58,079
didn't you just say they took the day off

592
00:27:58,799 --> 00:27:59,799
and weren't here?

593
00:28:01,079 --> 00:28:02,318
Pao Bei.

594
00:28:02,319 --> 00:28:04,078
Didn't you take the day off today?

595
00:28:04,079 --> 00:28:05,480
Why are you here all of a sudden?

596
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:08,518
Did you sneak in through the back door?

597
00:28:08,519 --> 00:28:10,078
There's a perfectly good front door,

598
00:28:10,079 --> 00:28:11,799
yet you always want to take the back.

599
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:24,960
Seems like you really have
a thing for the back door.

600
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:26,358
Right?

601
00:28:26,359 --> 00:28:27,359
What?

602
00:28:30,039 --> 00:28:33,000
You're even wearing my
clothes without asking.

603
00:28:36,799 --> 00:28:39,159
Let's go back and grab another
set of bowls and chopsticks.

604
00:28:43,319 --> 00:28:45,000
What did that jerk do to you?

605
00:28:45,039 --> 00:28:46,919
Did you just let him
push you around like that?

606
00:28:48,579 --> 00:28:50,140
Fuck that guy!

607
00:28:50,279 --> 00:28:51,518
Does having money make him untouchable?

608
00:28:51,519 --> 00:28:52,919
How dare he treat people like this!

609
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,000
Just as well.

610
00:28:55,001 --> 00:28:56,896
We're not done settling the
score from when he reported me.

611
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:59,160
I'll settle all old scores and
new debts with him today!

612
00:29:00,039 --> 00:29:00,880
Bro, what are you doing? Calm down!

613
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:01,880
Calm down!

614
00:29:02,319 --> 00:29:03,319
Let go of me!

615
00:29:03,320 --> 00:29:05,199
What are you doing? I'm
getting payback for you!

616
00:29:05,200 --> 00:29:06,640
Until I find my mom and the ring,

617
00:29:07,119 --> 00:29:08,400
what else can I do?

618
00:29:08,480 --> 00:29:10,040
I just have to bite the bullet for now.

619
00:29:10,119 --> 00:29:13,241
Besides, there are so many guys
out there. Can you even take them?

620
00:29:13,519 --> 00:29:15,319
Then what do you suggest we do?

621
00:29:15,519 --> 00:29:16,519
What's your plan?

622
00:29:22,759 --> 00:29:23,440
Boss P'Eng.

623
00:29:23,759 --> 00:29:25,199
You came in pretty aggressive today.

624
00:29:25,920 --> 00:29:26,920
Have a seat first.

625
00:29:34,799 --> 00:29:36,680
Run, of course!

626
00:29:37,839 --> 00:29:38,959
Where's your backbone?

627
00:29:38,960 --> 00:29:39,960
Chickening out already?

628
00:29:41,519 --> 00:29:42,799
We're outnumbered right now.

629
00:29:43,079 --> 00:29:44,656
Going head-to-head won't solve anything.

630
00:29:44,680 --> 00:29:45,976
If we don't run, what else can we do?

631
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:46,599
Run?

632
00:29:46,920 --> 00:29:48,359
You can run, but you can't hide.

633
00:29:48,799 --> 00:29:50,359
Doesn't he already know where you live?

634
00:29:50,480 --> 00:29:52,200
And do you know where to find your mom?

635
00:29:54,880 --> 00:29:56,440
The food here is really good.

636
00:29:56,599 --> 00:29:57,599
You should try it.

637
00:29:57,640 --> 00:29:59,680
Are you really just here to eat?

638
00:30:00,079 --> 00:30:01,079
Yeah.

639
00:30:01,736 --> 00:30:04,656
Honestly, I never really acquired
a taste for the food around here,

640
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:06,599
but the dishes here
are genuinely delicious.

641
00:30:07,640 --> 00:30:08,640
Oh, right.

642
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:11,520
You mentioned earlier that
you came to catch someone.

643
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:12,680
What happened?

644
00:30:12,681 --> 00:30:13,839
I heard from Master Chen

645
00:30:14,400 --> 00:30:15,535
that when you went for a massage last time,

646
00:30:15,559 --> 00:30:18,519
some jerk gave you "special service."

647
00:30:19,839 --> 00:30:20,839
Aren't you...

648
00:30:21,039 --> 00:30:22,279
curious who did it?

649
00:30:23,039 --> 00:30:25,839
So, did you find out who it was?

650
00:30:27,680 --> 00:30:28,720
I have a pretty good idea.

651
00:30:29,400 --> 00:30:30,400
It's definitely him.

652
00:30:30,839 --> 00:30:32,559
And who is he...?

653
00:30:34,759 --> 00:30:35,759
All right.

654
00:30:35,920 --> 00:30:37,118
Anything you can think of,

655
00:30:37,119 --> 00:30:38,240
they've already anticipated.

656
00:30:42,680 --> 00:30:43,359
Then...

657
00:30:43,480 --> 00:30:44,680
Then we fight them to the end!

658
00:30:47,799 --> 00:30:49,720
Come on, stop making trouble.

659
00:30:50,480 --> 00:30:51,799
Let's take these out first.

660
00:30:53,920 --> 00:30:54,920
You're right.

661
00:30:54,921 --> 00:30:56,480
They're customers after all,

662
00:30:56,799 --> 00:30:58,119
and we're just employees.

663
00:30:58,519 --> 00:31:00,279
We just have to serve
them properly for now.

664
00:31:02,200 --> 00:31:03,440
Okay, let's go.

665
00:31:18,039 --> 00:31:19,640
Who lit your fuse today?

666
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:21,200
I'm sorry.

667
00:31:21,319 --> 00:31:22,119
The bowls were just washed.

668
00:31:22,120 --> 00:31:23,519
His hands were a bit slippery.

669
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:25,960
Stop right there.

670
00:31:29,039 --> 00:31:30,039
What is it?

671
00:31:30,559 --> 00:31:32,799
Did the soy sauce from
that night still not wash off?

672
00:31:37,599 --> 00:31:38,599
He's the guy we're looking for!

673
00:31:38,600 --> 00:31:39,840
He's the one we're looking for!

674
00:31:41,960 --> 00:31:42,960
I know.

675
00:31:43,559 --> 00:31:44,559
You know?

676
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:48,160
I know who it is.

677
00:31:49,400 --> 00:31:51,119
But what I really want to know is,

678
00:31:51,519 --> 00:31:53,039
why did you do it?

679
00:31:53,400 --> 00:31:54,960
Did I offend you somehow?

680
00:31:57,759 --> 00:31:59,319
Blame him if you want to blame someone.

681
00:31:59,920 --> 00:32:00,920
Blame me?

682
00:32:01,519 --> 00:32:04,000
Blame me for reporting
your illegal business?

683
00:32:05,920 --> 00:32:07,240
So it really was you!

684
00:32:07,759 --> 00:32:08,759
That's right.

685
00:32:09,279 --> 00:32:10,319
It was me.

686
00:32:10,680 --> 00:32:12,240
Reporting an illegal business—

687
00:32:12,839 --> 00:32:14,239
is there something wrong with that?

688
00:32:15,359 --> 00:32:16,359
Hmm?

689
00:32:23,200 --> 00:32:24,200
Boss P'Eng!

690
00:32:25,759 --> 00:32:26,279
Young Master!

691
00:32:26,280 --> 00:32:27,360
Young Master, what's wrong?

692
00:32:27,559 --> 00:32:28,919
The spice must have gotten to him.

693
00:32:29,519 --> 00:32:30,319
Look at you.

694
00:32:30,319 --> 00:32:31,200
You can't handle spicy food.

695
00:32:31,201 --> 00:32:32,881
Why did you deliberately pick this to eat?

696
00:32:32,960 --> 00:32:34,759
If you can't take the heat, don't show off.

697
00:32:35,079 --> 00:32:36,079
Serves you right.

698
00:32:39,000 --> 00:32:40,080
Grab him and take him back!

699
00:32:40,319 --> 00:32:41,119
And the one behind him,

700
00:32:41,119 --> 00:32:42,119
bring him along too!

701
00:32:42,559 --> 00:32:43,720
Come on, cool off.

702
00:32:43,960 --> 00:32:46,440
Can't we just talk things out?

703
00:32:46,599 --> 00:32:47,319
Bring it on!

704
00:32:47,599 --> 00:32:48,640
Just try and grab me!

705
00:32:49,039 --> 00:32:50,959
You dare lay a finger
on me in broad daylight?

706
00:32:50,960 --> 00:32:52,095
I'll call the police right now!

707
00:32:52,119 --> 00:32:53,119
The police?

708
00:32:58,079 --> 00:32:59,079
Young Master!

709
00:32:59,799 --> 00:33:01,039
You dare flip my table?!

710
00:33:01,559 --> 00:33:02,559
Young Master!

711
00:33:04,960 --> 00:33:05,359
Young Master!

712
00:33:05,359 --> 00:33:06,359
Stop fighting!

713
00:33:13,640 --> 00:33:14,519
Acting tough, huh?

714
00:33:14,519 --> 00:33:15,519
Young Master!

715
00:33:18,240 --> 00:33:19,240
You coward!

716
00:33:19,359 --> 00:33:21,079
Fight me one-on-one if you've got the guts!

717
00:33:21,200 --> 00:33:22,640
Ganging up on me is pathetic!

718
00:33:23,039 --> 00:33:24,039
Let him go!

719
00:33:24,359 --> 00:33:25,400
A one-on-one? You're on.

720
00:33:27,559 --> 00:33:28,559
Young Master!

721
00:33:32,839 --> 00:33:33,839
Boss P'Eng!

722
00:33:34,759 --> 00:33:35,759
Stop fighting!

723
00:33:35,880 --> 00:33:36,880
Everyone, stop!

724
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:44,000
Please let him go.

725
00:33:46,119 --> 00:33:47,119
I'll go with you.

726
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,319
I'll take full responsibility.

727
00:34:15,920 --> 00:34:18,559
Busy all day and haven't
had a single bite to eat.

728
00:34:49,880 --> 00:34:51,079
Forget it.

729
00:34:51,519 --> 00:34:53,879
Once I've had enough to drink,
I won't feel hungry anymore.

730
00:35:27,119 --> 00:35:28,400
Who is it?

731
00:35:43,519 --> 00:35:44,679
What's going on?

732
00:35:45,079 --> 00:35:46,320
Finally came to your senses?

733
00:35:48,039 --> 00:35:49,079
Let me in.

734
00:35:49,599 --> 00:35:51,079
We're not done talking.

735
00:36:12,440 --> 00:36:13,440
Go ahead.

736
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:16,000
What else do you have to add?

737
00:36:16,599 --> 00:36:18,239
The money my mother owes you,

738
00:36:19,039 --> 00:36:20,400
I will definitely pay it back.

739
00:36:21,880 --> 00:36:24,000
Just please leave my friend A Pong alone,

740
00:36:24,519 --> 00:36:25,760
and my younger siblings too.

741
00:36:28,079 --> 00:36:30,639
Your friend got what he deserved.

742
00:36:31,800 --> 00:36:33,238
That and your mother owing me money

743
00:36:33,239 --> 00:36:34,719
are two completely different matters.

744
00:36:37,719 --> 00:36:38,719
Fine.

745
00:36:39,199 --> 00:36:41,159
Then will you leave my
younger siblings alone?

746
00:36:42,800 --> 00:36:45,159
Let them live and go to school in peace.

747
00:36:48,880 --> 00:36:51,079
No.

748
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:04,280
What are you glaring at me for?

749
00:37:09,159 --> 00:37:10,280
Let me ask you.

750
00:37:11,760 --> 00:37:13,800
How exactly are you going to pay me back?

751
00:37:28,440 --> 00:37:29,880
I'm asking you.

752
00:37:30,280 --> 00:37:31,840
How are you going to pay me back?

753
00:37:34,320 --> 00:37:36,800
What do you even have to your name?

754
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:46,199
Even the clothes on your back

755
00:37:47,599 --> 00:37:49,239
belong to me.

756
00:38:01,239 --> 00:38:02,239
That's enough.

757
00:38:02,639 --> 00:38:04,199
You have nothing.

758
00:38:04,840 --> 00:38:06,360
Just keep working here,

759
00:38:06,559 --> 00:38:08,079
earn your honest money,

760
00:38:09,119 --> 00:38:10,559
so that thief of a mother of yours...

761
00:38:10,719 --> 00:38:11,719
What did you say?

762
00:38:14,639 --> 00:38:15,559
What do I have?

763
00:38:15,599 --> 00:38:16,920
Tonight, I'll show you

764
00:38:18,559 --> 00:38:19,559
what I have.

765
00:39:02,159 --> 00:39:03,159
What's the matter?

766
00:39:04,280 --> 00:39:05,639
Don't even know how to kiss?

767
00:39:09,079 --> 00:39:11,239
Is this your first time kissing a man?

768
00:39:21,320 --> 00:39:23,079
Show me what you've got.

769
00:39:24,239 --> 00:39:25,719
Don't tell me this is all you can do.

770
00:40:20,480 --> 00:40:21,719
What are you doing with that?

771
00:40:31,916 --> 00:40:33,843
[Tuesday March 10th is calling???]

772
00:40:35,360 --> 00:40:36,360
Get out.

773
00:40:39,840 --> 00:40:40,840
Get out!

774
00:41:06,199 --> 00:41:07,199
Hello?
